---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Precision 3D Printing & Prototyping"
description: "Precision 3D printing & prototyping for business and individuals. Engineering-grade materials, fast response, local Cambridgeshire delivery and UK-wide shipping."
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Brampton, Huntingdon · UK-wide shipping</p>
      <h1>Precision 3D Printing &amp; Prototyping for Business and Individuals.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Engineering-grade materials, careful quality checks, and a fast response — usually within 1 hour during working hours.</p>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/quote/' | url }}">Get a Quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/services/' | url }}">Explore Services</a>
      </div>

      <div class="badges">
        <div class="badge"><span class="dot gray"></span>Project-based pricing</div>
        <div class="badge"><span class="dot green"></span>Engineering-grade materials</div>
        <div class="badge"><span class="dot"></span>Local delivery from £5</div>
        <div class="badge"><span class="dot"></span>UK shipping from £2.75</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="kicker">Quick contact</div>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:10px 0 12px">Prefer to message?</p>
        <div class="grid gap-10">
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ company.whatsappUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="whatsapp_click">WhatsApp</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:{{ company.phoneE164 }}" data-track="phone_click">Call {{ company.phone }}</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:{{ company.email }}" data-track="email_click">Email {{ company.email }}</a>
        </div>
        <p class="tiny muted" style="margin:12px 0 0">{{ company.locationShort }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="h2">Services</h2>
    <p class="muted">A small, professional production partner — flexible on one-offs, reliable on repeat runs.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-4 mt-16">
      <a class="card card-link" href="{{ '/services/fdm/' | url }}">
        <div class="card-media"><img src="{{ '/assets/images/Precision-3D-Printed-Gears.webp' | url }}" alt="FDM 3D printing example" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="kicker">FDM</div>
          <h3 class="h3">FDM 3D Printing</h3>
          <p class="muted">Functional parts, fixtures, housings and prototypes in engineering-grade materials.</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="card card-link" href="{{ '/services/resin/' | url }}">
        <div class="card-media"><img src="{{ '/assets/images/12K-MSLA-Resin-Miniature.webp' | url }}" alt="Resin 3D printing example" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="kicker">Resin</div>
          <h3 class="h3">Resin 3D Printing</h3>
          <p class="muted">High-detail prints for miniatures, prototypes, and precision components.</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="card card-link" href="{{ '/services/design-support/' | url }}">
        <div class="card-media"><img src="{{ '/assets/images/Reverse-Engineered-Tripod-Joint.webp' | url }}" alt="Reverse engineered 3D part example" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="kicker">CAD</div>
          <h3 class="h3">3D Design &amp; File Support</h3>
          <p class="muted">Don’t have a file? We can design, adjust, or recreate parts for print.</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="card card-link" href="{{ '/services/batch-production/' | url }}">
        <div class="card-media"><img src="{{ '/assets/images/Batch-Production-Example.webp' | url }}" alt="Batch production example" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="kicker">B2B</div>
          <h3 class="h3">Batch &amp; Commercial Production</h3>
          <p class="muted">Repeat runs, sample approval, QC checks and batch discounts.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/services/' | url }}">View all services</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-muted">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="h2">Materials</h2>
    <p class="muted">PLA, PETG, ABS, ASA, TPU, Nylon, carbon-fibre composites, and precision resin options.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-3 mt-16">
      <a class="card card-link" href="{{ '/materials/' | url }}" aria-label="Materials overview">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="kicker">Guide</div>
          <h3 class="h3">Choose the right material</h3>
          <p class="muted">A simple guide to strength, heat resistance, flexibility, and surface finish.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="card card-link" href="{{ '/materials/resin/' | url }}">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="kicker">MSLA</div>
          <h3 class="h3">Resin options</h3>
          <p class="muted">Water-washable grey by default, ABS-like, flexible, and transparent on request.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="card card-link" href="{{ '/quote/' | url }}">
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="kicker">Not sure?</div>
          <h3 class="h3">We’ll help you decide</h3>
          <p class="muted">Describe your part and we’ll recommend material and process.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="h2">Portfolio</h2>
    <p class="muted">A selection of recent prints and prototype work.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-3 mt-16">
      {% for cs in collections.caseStudies | slice(0, 6) %}
        <a class="card card-link" href="{{ cs.url | url }}">
          <div class="card-media"><img src="{{ cs.data.coverImage | url }}" alt="{{ cs.data.title }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="kicker">{{ cs.data.tech }}</div>
            <h3 class="h3">{{ cs.data.title }}</h3>
            <p class="muted">{{ cs.data.summary }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/case-studies/' | url }}">View all case studies</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    {% include "partials/cta-wide.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
